  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "🧌 Orc Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Short, hard names with a reputation attached: Murzag Skullsplitter, Ushra the Unkillable, Hrukgar of the Broken Tusk."
    },
    "intro": "Good orc names are short, hard and easy to shout across a battlefield, like Ghorok or Ushza. Then they need something extra: what they did, what they look like, or which <a href=\"clan-name-generator.html\">clan</a> they'd die for. This **orc name generator** builds names from the harsh sounds orcs have had since Tolkien, and adds a deed-name, a nickname, a clan or a shaman's title.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Ten good orc names",
